cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "midnight-reasoning"
abstract: >-
  Cross-run reasoning graph for the MidnightDev agent stack: resolved reflection nodes
  persisted as Graphiti episodes that later runs can recall, plus an append-only
  in-flight sidecar for the current run, with Graphiti as an injected port rather than
  an embedded client.
